            "review_text": "Freedom21151974728\n3 contributions\n0\nThe best Vegeterian Indian food ever\nJul 2024 • Family\nI was looking for pure vegeterian Indian food and i found this restaurant was amazing. Food was so delicous and authentic. People were so nice and friendly. Price very cheap to be honest. Hightly recommend !\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 1, 2024\nCoastal35773102363\n“Thank you so much for your kind words! We’re thrilled to hear that you enjoyed our authentic vegetarian Indian dishes and had a positive experience with our team. It means a lot to us that you appreciate our efforts to provide delicious food at affordable prices. We look forward to welcoming you back soon for more flavorful experiences. Your recommendation is greatly appreciated!”\nRead more\nWritten August 5, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
